        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira kabiri umwami Dariyo ari ku ngoma, mu kwezi kwa gatandatu, ku musi wakwo wa mbere, ijambo ry’Uhoraho ryavugiye muri Hagayi uwavugishwa na we, ritumwe kuri Zerubabeli icēgēra c’uwo mwami i Buyuda, mwene Sheyalitiyeli, no kuri Yosuwa umuherezi mukuru, mwene Yehozadaki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rit’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize, at’ Iri hanga rivuga ngw Igihe ntikiragera, igihe co kwongera kwubaka ingoro y’Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ijambo ry’Uhoraho rivugira muri Hagayi uwavugishwa na we, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.64.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 64:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "riti Mbeg’ iki n’igihe kibereye c’uko mwebge mwokwibera mu mazu yanyu ajererenze amagarwe, na yo iyi ngoro igihomvaguritse? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero, uku ni k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize, ati Ni mwitegereze uko mumeze! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 4:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.6.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 6:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubiba vyinshi, mukimbura bike; kurya murarya, ariko ntimushira inzara; kunywa muranywa, ariko ntimushira inyota; kwambara murambara, ariko ntimushira imbeho; kand’ ūca amahera ayacira mu mupfuko utobotse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
