              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enda ni mudūge mu mugamba muzane ibiti, mwubake iyo ngoro; nanje nzoyinezererwa, bimpeshe icubahiro, ni k’Uhoraho agize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaziga vyinshi, mugize murtya musanga ni bike; kandi n’iyo mubizanye i muhira ndabitūvya. Biva ku ki? ni k’ Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo abajije. Biva ku ngoro yanje irekewe ngaho igihomvaguritse, namwe mweho umuntu wese agakobereza inzu yiwe ubgiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
