              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nahamagaye uruzuba ngo rwice isi n’imisozi, rukūreho n’impeke na vino, n’amavuta ya elayo, rwice n’ibimera mu ndimiro, n’abantu, n’amasho, n’ibikorwa vyose bikoreshwa amaboko.",
          "type": "text",
