        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalitiyeli, na Yosuwa umuherezi mukuru mwene Yehozadaki, hamwe n’amasigarira yose yo mur’ iryo hanga, bumvira ijwi ry’ Uhoraho Imana yabo, n’amajambo ya Hagayi uwo yavugisha, nk’uk’ Uhoraho Imana yabo yamutumye; kand’ abantu baterwa n’ubgoba imbere y’Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
