        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Uhoraho akangura umutima wa Zerubabeli yaganza i Buyuda, mwene Sheyalitiyeli, n’umutima wa Yosuwa umuherezi mukuru, mwene Yehozadaki, n’imitima y’amasigarira yose y’iryo hanga; baraza batangura gukora ku ngoro y’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo Imana yabo, ",
